 "turns": [
  {
   "n": 0,
   "role": "beaver",
   "t": 16.4,
   "wall": 1789315888.084,
   "text": "You're stuck on that one again?! That's the first one, moron! I asked for \"When is your birthday?\". Try again, and don't give me the wrong answer! Hurry up!",
   "kind": "",
   "stt": "",
   "tags": [
    "조각1 마지막 턴(재생 — 실제 조각2 발화 아님)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 1,
   "role": "learner",
   "t": 17.2,
   "wall": 1789315888.887,
   "text": "I don't know.",
   "kind": "idk",
   "stt": "I don't know.",
   "tags": []
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "role": "beaver",
   "t": 28.8,
   "wall": 1789315900.437,
   "text": "Ugh, you don't know again? Pathetic! Fine, listen carefully. How do you say \"person\" in Korean? Try saying it.",
   "kind": "",
   "stt": "",
   "tags": [
    "→사람(quote=\"person\")",
    "새항목#1 정책1 선질문✔"
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "role": "learner",
   "t": 29.6,
   "wall": 1789315901.247,
   "text": "사람요",
   "kind": "correct",
   "stt": "사람요.",
   "tags": []
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "role": "beaver",
   "t": 42.6,
   "wall": 1789315914.239,
   "text": "Hmph, you finally got one right. Don't get too excited, that was easy. Now, how about this: how do you say \"country\" in Korean? Spit it out.",
   "kind": "",
   "stt": "",
   "tags": [
    "→나라(quote=\"country\")",
    "새항목#2 정책2 선질문✔"
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "role": "learner",
   "t": 43.4,
   "wall": 1789315915.033,
   "text": "I don't know.",
   "kind": "idk",
   "stt": "I don't know.",
   "tags": []
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "role": "beaver",
   "t": 54.0,
   "wall": 1789315925.633,
   "text": "Seriously? You don't know that one either? Unbelievable. It's '나라'. Now try saying it. Come on!",
   "kind": "",
   "stt": "",
   "tags": [
    "표면형:나라",
    "→나라(reveal)",
    "드릴공개"
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "role": "learner",
   "t": 54.8,
   "wall": 1789315926.448,
   "text": "나라요",
   "kind": "parrot",
   "stt": "날아요.",
   "tags": []
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "role": "beaver",
   "t": 67.6,
   "wall": 1789315939.279,
   "text": "Finally, you managed to repeat it. Don't think you're smart now. Okay, next. How do you say \"hometown\" in Korean? Don't disappoint me again.",
   "kind": "",
   "stt": "",
   "tags": [
    "→고향(quote=\"hometown\")",
    "새항목#3 정책3 선질문✔"
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "role": "learner",
   "t": 68.4,
   "wall": 1789315940.086,
   "text": "고향요",
   "kind": "correct",
   "stt": "고양이요.",
   "tags": []
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "role": "beaver",
   "t": 79.9,
   "wall": 1789315951.527,
   "text": "Wow, you actually knew that one? Shocking. Don't get cocky. Now, how do you say \"foreigner\" in Korean? Hurry up.",
   "kind": "",
   "stt": "",
   "tags": [
    "→외국인(quote=\"foreigner\")",
    "새항목#4 정책4 선질문✔"
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "role": "learner",
   "t": 80.7,
   "wall": 1789315952.326,
   "text": "저",
   "kind": "distractor",
   "stt": "",
   "tags": [
    "재발화(전사 없음)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 12,
   "role": "learner",
   "t": 85.6,
   "wall": 1789315957.25,
   "text": "저 친구는 외국인이에요.",
   "kind": "distractor",
   "stt": "저 저 친구는 외국인이에요.",
   "tags": [
    "재발화"
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 13,
   "role": "beaver",
   "t": 102.9,
   "wall": 1789315974.561,
   "text": "HA! Did you just say '저 친구는'? I didn't teach you that yet! Where did you learn that? Fine, I guess I'll accept it. Next, tell me how to say \"the United States\" in Korean. Don't mess this up.",
   "kind": "",
   "stt": "",
   "tags": [
    "표면형:저",
    "→미국(quote=\"the united states\")",
    "새항목#5 정책5 선질문✔"
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 14,
   "role": "learner",
